  "summary": {
    "plain": "In its first weeks of data XENON100 saw no events in the signal region.",
    "technical": "11.17 live days of non-blind data (October-November 2009), 40 kg fiducial target; 90% CL limit of 3.4e-44 cm^2 at 55 GeV/c^2. Below 20 GeV/c^2 the result constrains the interpretation of the CoGeNT and DAMA signals as spin-independent elastic light-mass WIMP interactions, as the abstract states."
